<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5444] Collections.singletonList is not properly serialized by binary marshaller</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5444</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Test attached. &lt;tt&gt;Collections.singletonList&lt;/tt&gt; is apparently serialized by optimized marshaller, because when deserialized, it doesn&apos;t return collection of binary objects, but rather collection of deserialized objects.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Most likely the reason for this is that &lt;tt&gt;Collections.singletonList&lt;/tt&gt; is not recognized by &lt;tt&gt;BinaryUtils.knownCollection&lt;/tt&gt; method.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13078168">IGNITE-5444</key>
            <summary>Collections.singletonList is not properly serialized by binary marshaller</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
